  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The length of a rectangle is <math alttext=\"50\"><mn>50</mn>\n</math> inches and the width is <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> inches. The perimeter is at most <math alttext=\"210\"><mn>210</mn>\n</math> inches. Which inequality represents this situation?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
    {
      "id": "16300184-b87a-473a-8dc0-f051c0172303",
      "content": "<p><math alttext=\"2 x plus 100 less than or equals 210\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mrow><mn>210</mn></mrow></math></p>"
    },
    {
